"**Private Vulnerability Reporting**: Please submit a report through "
"[GitHub Private Vulnerability "
"Reporting](https://github.com/bdperkin/findfmt/security/advisories/new)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../SECURITY.md:36 ebae6980a8664a9a80a585d72fa77aa8
msgid ""
